The source origins, versions and checksums are specified in upstream.json. Building does not acquire ViaFabricPlus binary or source archives. Java protocol libraries and build inputs are pinned separately in libraries.json, toolchain.json and game-inputs.json. Original license notices of retained libraries remain in their archives.

ToolVisuals modifications: Java release protocols starting with 1.7.2, guarded saved and per-server selections, removal of Bedrock transports and platform libraries, and integration with the ToolVisuals version menu. The modified distribution is identified in Fabric metadata and its embedded component manifest.
